WEBVTT

00:08:29.833 --> 00:08:31.268
When you think about these --

00:08:31.292 --> 00:08:35.018
EP: But if the people don't perform,
if the people decide to go on strike,

00:08:35.042 --> 00:08:37.976
if the people underproduce,

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:41.226
if the people decide
to undermine the grand project,

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.184
doesn't that give them power?

00:08:43.208 --> 00:08:46.559
AG: It can, sure. The CEO, though,
also can take power back by saying,

00:08:46.583 --> 00:08:50.059
"I'm going to fire those people
or I'm going to stop paying those people.

00:08:50.083 --> 00:08:51.809
I'm going to replace those people."

00:08:51.833 --> 00:08:53.893
And so these dynamics get complicated.

00:08:53.917 --> 00:08:57.584
Where do you draw the line and who has
more power in total or do you not care?

00:08:57.608 --> 00:09:00.059
Are you willing to take
the multiple layers?